2697	// 解析整个 iCalendar 文件；任何结构错误、关键属性重复或缺失都抛出 BizError（整批失败）
2698	function parseIcalFile(text: string, file: string): IcalEvent[] {
2699	  const bad = (reason: string): never => {
2700	    throw new BizError(`iCalendar 文件 ${file} 无法导入：${reason}（整批未导入，数据未改动）`);
2701	  };
2702	  const lines = unfoldIcalLines(text, bad);
2703	  if (lines.length === 0) bad('文件为空');
2704	
2705	  const events: IcalEvent[] = [];
2706	  const seenUids = new Set<string>();
2707	  let inCalendar = false;
2708	  let calendarEnded = false;
2709	  let versionSeen = false;
2710	  let inEvent = false;
2711	  let curUid: string | undefined;
2712	  let curStart: {raw: string; min: number} | undefined;
2713	  let curEnd: {raw: string; min: number} | undefined;
2714	
2715	  const closeEvent = (): void => {
2716	    if (curUid === undefined) bad('VEVENT 缺少 UID 属性');
2717	    if (curStart === undefined) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）缺少 DTSTART 属性`);
2718	    if (curEnd === undefined) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）缺少 DTEND 属性`);
2719	    if (curEnd.min <= curStart.min) {
2720	      bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）结束时间必须晚于开始时间（${curStart.raw} → ${curEnd.raw}），允许跨日`);
2721	    }
2722	    if (seenUids.has(curUid)) bad(`文件内 UID 重复: “${curUid}”（解码后区分大小写）`);
2723	    seenUids.add(curUid);
2724	    events.push({
2725	      uid: curUid,
2726	      startRaw: curStart.raw,
2727	      endRaw: curEnd.raw,
2728	      startMin: curStart.min,
2729	      endMin: curEnd.min,
2730	    });
2731	    inEvent = false;
2732	    curUid = undefined;
2733	    curStart = undefined;
2734	    curEnd = undefined;
2735	  };
2736	
2737	  for (const line of lines) {
2738	    const {name, params, value} = parseContentLine(line, bad);
2739	
2740	    if (name === 'BEGIN') {
2741	      const comp = value.trim().toUpperCase();
2742	      if (calendarEnded) bad('END:VCALENDAR 之后仍有内容');
2743	      if (!inCalendar) {
2744	        if (comp !== 'VCALENDAR') bad(`顶层组件必须是 VCALENDAR，实际为 “${value.trim()}”`);
2745	        inCalendar = true;
2746	      } else if (!inEvent) {
2747	        if (comp !== 'VEVENT') bad(`不支持的组件 “${value.trim()}”（仅接受 VEVENT）`);
2748	        inEvent = true;
2749	        curUid = undefined;
2750	        curStart = undefined;
2751	        curEnd = undefined;
2752	      } else {
2753	        bad(`事件内不允许嵌套组件 “${value.trim()}”（如 VALARM）`);
2754	      }
2755	      continue;
2756	    }
2757	    if (name === 'END') {
2758	      const comp = value.trim().toUpperCase();
2759	      if (!inCalendar) bad('END 出现在 BEGIN:VCALENDAR 之前');
2760	      if (inEvent) {
2761	        if (comp !== 'VEVENT') bad(`END:${value.trim()} 与 BEGIN:VEVENT 不匹配`);
2762	        closeEvent();
2763	      } else {
2764	        if (comp !== 'VCALENDAR') bad(`END:${value.trim()} 没有匹配的 BEGIN`);
2765	        inCalendar = false;
2766	        calendarEnded = true;
2767	      }
2768	      continue;
2769	    }
2770	
2771	    if (calendarEnded) bad('END:VCALENDAR 之后仍有内容');
2772	    if (!inCalendar) bad(`属性 “${name}” 出现在 BEGIN:VCALENDAR 之前`);
2773	
2774	    if (!inEvent) {
2775	      // 日历级属性：VERSION 必须恰为 2.0；METHOD:CANCEL 为取消事件，拒绝
2776	      if (name === 'VERSION') {
2777	        if (versionSeen) bad('VERSION 属性重复');
2778	        versionSeen = true;
2779	        if (value.trim() !== '2.0') bad(`仅支持 VERSION:2.0，实际为 “${value.trim()}”`);
2780	      } else if (name === 'METHOD' && value.trim().toUpperCase() === 'CANCEL') {
2781	        bad('取消事件（METHOD:CANCEL）不支持导入');
2782	      }
2783	      // 其余日历级属性（PRODID、CALSCALE 等）忽略
2784	      continue;
2785	    }
2786	
2787	    // 事件内属性
2788	    switch (name) {
2789	      case 'UID': {
2790	        if (curUid !== undefined) bad(`VEVENT 内 UID 属性重复（首个为 “${curUid}”）`);
2791	        const uid = unescapeIcalText(value);
2792	        if (uid === '') bad('VEVENT 的 UID 不能为空');
2793	        curUid = uid;
2794	        break;
2795	      }
2796	      case 'DTSTART': {
2797	        if (curStart !== undefined) bad('VEVENT 内 DTSTART 属性重复');
2798	        assertFloatingDateTimeParams(params, 'DTSTART ', bad);
2799	        curStart = parseIcalDateTime(value.trim(), 'DTSTART ', bad);
2800	        break;
2801	      }
2802	      case 'DTEND': {
2803	        if (curEnd !== undefined) bad('VEVENT 内 DTEND 属性重复');
2804	        assertFloatingDateTimeParams(params, 'DTEND ', bad);
2805	        curEnd = parseIcalDateTime(value.trim(), 'DTEND ', bad);
2806	        break;
2807	      }
2808	      case 'STATUS': {
2809	        if (value.trim().toUpperCase() === 'CANCELLED') {
2810	          bad('取消事件（STATUS:CANCELLED）不支持导入');
2811	        }
2812	        break;
2813	      }
2814	      case 'DESCRIPTION':
2815	        break; // 描述属性忽略
2816	      default:
2817	        if (ICAL_RECURRENCE_PROPS.has(name)) {
2818	          bad(`不支持重复相关属性 ${name}（不导入重复事件）`);
2819	        }
2820	        // 其余属性（SUMMARY、LOCATION、DTSTAMP、SEQUENCE 等）忽略
2821	    }
2822	  }
2823	
2824	  if (inEvent) bad('VEVENT 缺少对应的 END:VEVENT');
2825	  if (inCalendar) bad('VCALENDAR 缺少对应的 END:VCALENDAR');
2826	  if (!versionSeen) bad('缺少 VERSION:2.0 属性');
2827	  if (events.length === 0) bad('VCALENDAR 中没有任何 VEVENT（至少需要一个独立事件）');
2828	  return events;
2829	}
